OL,3,AAnthropic bans users from being 'cruel'
OL,4,Ato its AI systems
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile Anthropic said the policy would
OL,7,Fonly apply in "extreme cases" of
OL,8,Frepeated abuse, it has reignited debate
OL,9,Fover how we should communicate with AI
OL,10,Ftools.
